// Signing configuration, shared.
//
// The Apple Developer Team ID is per-developer account information, not a
// property of the project, so it does not belong in version control. It lives
// in Local.xcconfig, which is untracked — copy Local.xcconfig.example to
// Local.xcconfig and put your own team there.
//
// The include is optional (`#include?`, with the question mark). A clone that
// has no Local.xcconfig still builds: DEVELOPMENT_TEAM stays empty and Xcode
// falls back to ad-hoc "Sign to Run Locally", which is enough to run the app
// locally. It is not enough to notarize or distribute — that needs a real team.
#include? "Local.xcconfig"
